w entries. Duplicate entries need no write.'],important_branches=['Missing or mismatching previous entry rejects with NoRetryBackoff. Read, delete and write errors reject. Failure after suffix deletion can leave cached lastLog stale (source TODO).','If LeaderCommitIndex advances, set min(leader commit, local last index), commit eligible configuration and processLogs. Empty heartbeat has no previous index or commit advancement.'],produces_fact_ids=['f-append-accepted'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Normal success supplies a replication acknowledgment and follower consumes leader commit index.','A2':'Append receipt can update durable term and demote local role.'},unknowns=['Fast-path concurrent term transitions require a separate interleaving analysis; comments saying main-thread-only conflict with callback wiring.'])\nbehavior('b-replicate','A1','Per-peer replication worker and pipeline decoder','Captured followerReplication.currentTerm, peer ID, commitment object, request entries','Trigger, CommitTimeout or pipeline completion',['s-replication','s-pipeline','s-match-notify','s-repl-ownership','s-network-pipeline','s-inmem-pipeline'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-append-accepted'],produces_fact_ids=['f-match'],implementation_guards=['Ordinary RPC transport error does not match. Higher reply term invokes handleStaleTerm and stops. Successful nonempty reply matches last request entry.'],important_branches=['Reject backs off nextIndex; missing log invokes snapshot fallback; successful sync enables pipeline. Pipeline checks Term and Success but does not call ready.Error before reading Response.'],async_boundaries=['Captured commitment and stepDown channels belong to one leaderState generation.','Pipeline producer completes futures including error cases before publishing them.'],existing_protections=['Old workers retain old commitment object rather than attaching support to a later leader generation.'],unknowns=['Whether a transport error can leave an apparently successful pipeli