e and respond nil afterwards.'],important_branches=['Batching requires response count equal sent commands/configurations; mismatch panics. Barrier not sent to ApplyBatch. Optional ConfigurationStore receives configurations on single path. Restore opens snapshot, invokes FSM restore then completes restoreFuture.'],cross_activity_effects={'A7':'Error completion synchronizes access to FSM response; application-returned errors are Response values, separate from Raft Error.'})\nbehavior('b-vote','A2','requestVote RPC receiver','Candidate address/ID, request term, local latest configuration and last entry','RequestVote delivered',['s-vote','s-stable-context'],produces_fact_ids=['f-vote-granted'],implementation_guards=['Reject unknown candidate ID when configuration nonempty; reject competing known leader unless transfer; reject old term; reject nonvoter candidate; compare last log term then index.'],durable_effects=['Adopt higher term through stable store. Persist vote term then candidate bytes before granting new vote.'],important_branches=['Duplicate same-term vote grants only matching candidate bytes; it returns before freshness comparison. Storage read/write errors reject; current-term persistence failure panics.'],existing_protections=['Persistent per-term candidate selection and log freshness checks.'],unknowns=['Two separate vote writes: partial-failure/recovery contract of selected StableStore remains to be investigated.'])\nbehavior('b-campaign','A2','runFollower/runCandidate and per-voter request workers','Campaign-local response channels, latest voter configuration and term','Eligible follower timeout, retry timeout, or transfer nomination',['s-follower','s-election','s-campaign','s-prevote','s-timeout-config','s-transfer'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-vote-granted'],produces_fact_ids=['f-leader-generation'],writes=['Pre-vote when supported and enabled; after enough grants persist next term, self vote and dispatch RequestVote to each other voter; tally majority into Leader role.'],important_branches=['Pre-vote unsupported RPC can count as grant only for preliminary round; real election still required. Higher response term demotes. Each campaign has a new buffered response channel; late old replies do not feed next tally.','TimeoutNow selects Candidate and transfer flag; transfer skips pre-vote and permits vote despite known leader. Sender waits for replication nextIndex beyond lastIndex before TimeoutNow.'],existing_protections=['Campaign sources are selected voters; voter IDs unique in validated configuration; one request worker per voter per campaign.'],unknowns=['Transfer timeout races and malformed/untrusted RPC behavior are not evaluated.'])\nbehavior('b-leader-life','A2','runLeader setup and deferred cleanup; leaderLoop','A new leaderState generation with first new index = getLastIndex()+1','Enter or leave Leader role',['s-leader-life','s-leader-loop','s-repl-ownership','s-transfer','s-match-notify'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-leader-generation'],writes=['Fresh commitment/inflight/replState/notification/stepDown objects. Start workers and dispatch initial noop.'],important_branches=['On exit close peer stop channels, fail inflight and pending verification futures with ErrLeadershipLost, clear generation state. Higher-term replication signal, incoming RPC, lease failure or committed self removal can cause exit.'],existing_protections=['New commitment starts with zero matches and current-term threshold. Stored old entries survive; late worker matches update old object.','Lease counts recent contact only for latest voters; it is not a read lease contract.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Prior stored entries can be committed under new leader after current-term support is re-established.','A7':'Leadership loss fails pending futures without proving writes absent from future history.'})\nbehavior('b-config','A4','Main loop: configurationChangeChIfStable/appendConfigurationEntry; follower configuration parser','Latest and committed configuration/index plus current leader generation','Membership change request or incoming configuration entry',['s-repl-ownership','s-dispatch','s-rpc','s-config-change','s-membership-contract'],writes=['New configuration becomes latest after dispatch; commitment voter set changes immediately; replication workers started/stopped for all peers. Incoming next configuration marks previous latest committed.'],implementation_guards=['Leader admission requires latest configuration committed and current-term entry committed. Optional prevIndex must match. Configuration validation rejects duplicate/empty IDs or addresses and zero voters.'],important_branches=['Retained IDs preserve match indices; new voters start at zero. Address updates reuse existing per-ID worker. Follower suffix conflict can revert latest to committed.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Latest voter membership defines which match slots participate in majority.','A2':'Latest voter membership controls elections and lease; committed local removal leads to step-down.'})\nbehavior('b-recover','A3','NewRaft initialization before starting workers','Stable term, log suffix and chosen snapshot','Construct/restart Raft',['s-startup','s-bootstrap','s-rpc'],writes=['Initialize Follower, load stable term and last log, restore first usable snapshot, initialize snapshot/configuration metadata, scan remaining logs for configurations.'],important_branches=['Snapshot restore failure tries older snapshots; if none usable construction fails. NoSnapshotRestoreOnStart skips FSM restore but accepts metadata. Bootstrap rejects existing state and stores term 1/config log 1.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Recovered log and snapshot boundaries supply future replication and vote freshness.','A2':'Volatile leader authority is not restored; loaded term/configuration constrain fresh election.'},unknowns=['Backend persistence guarantees, automatic snapshot production/compaction and forced RecoverCluster internals are not mapped.'])\nbehavior('b-install','A3','Snapshot sender replication worker, receiver main loop and FSM restore worker','Captured leader term, snapshot index/term and configuration','Missing log on replication -> sendLatestSnapshot -> InstallSnapshot',['s-snapshot-send','s-install','s-fsm'],produces_fact_ids=['f-match'],implementation_guards=['Receiver validates version and rejects old term; adopts higher term. Checks transferred length, closes sink, waits for FSM restore. Sender rejects higher reply term and matches only on Success.'],writes=['Receiver updates lastApplied, lastSnapshot and both configurations; compacts/removes logs. Sender sets nextIndex=meta.Index+1 and matches captured peer ID.'],important_branches=['Copy, sink and FSM errors reject. Post-restore compaction errors are logged but success remains possible.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Successful snapshot reply contributes snapshot index to same leader commitment object.','A2':'Snapshot request carries context term and establishes recovered participation metadata.'})\nbehavior('b-heartbeat','A2','Independent per-peer heartbeat goroutine','Captured replication term, peer, shared LastContact and pending verification notifications','Periodic interval or notifyCh',['s-heartbeat','s-replication','s-rpc','s-network-dispatch','s-inmem-heartbeat'],produces_fact_ids=['f-contact','f-verification-notification'],writes=['On transport success update contact timestamp and call notifyAll(resp.Success).'],important_branches=['Transport errors back off and do not update contact; response Term is not inspected here. Negative Success submits negative verification support.'],async_boundaries=['Runs independently of blocked ordinary replication. Network transport dispatches structurally empty heartbeats directly; in-memory transport queues them.'],existing_protections=['Higher-term rejection from appendEntries gives Success=false; pending verification may then force step-down. Ordinary replication and lease still run.'])\nbehavior('b-lease','A2','Leader main loop: checkLeaderLease','Latest voter set, peer contact timestamps and LeaderLeaseTimeout','Lease timer',['s-transfer','s-leader-loop'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-contact'],implementation_guards=['Counts only voters including local self; if contacted count below voter majority set Follower.'],unknowns=['Contact timestamp establishes transport response receipt, not successful acknowledgment of current authority. Whether this distinction permits a relevant bad endpoint needs a controlled schedule.'])\nbehavior('b-notify-replication','A2','Successful replication or snapshot worker; handleStaleTerm','Per-worker pending verification map','Successful append/snapshot or higher-term reply',['s-match-notify','s-snapshot-send','s-replication'],produces_fact_ids=['f-verification-notification'],writes=['notifyAll swaps out pending map under lock and calls vote once per registered future. Successful append/snapshot notifies true; stale term notifies false and signals stepDown.'],existing_protections=['Per-worker map draining prevents repeated notification of same registration.'])\nbehavior('b-verify','A2','verifyLeader registration; verifyFuture.vote; leaderLoop result consumer','Future object, captured voter-majority threshold, replication-worker registrations','Public VerifyLeader enqueues future',['s-verify-api','s-leader-loop','s-verify-vote','s-repl-ownership'],consumes_fact_ids=['f-verification-notification'],writes=['Initialize self vote and voter quorum threshold; register future with all replState workers; first negative or enough positive votes re-enqueues future. LeaderLoop responds success if tally meets threshold, otherwise demotes and returns ErrNotLeader.'],important_branches=['Single-voter threshold completes immediately; registrations do not filter Suffrage. Vote lock and nil notifyCh prevent multiple final notifications. Leader cleanup fails pending verification on exit.'],unknowns=['Need distinguish intended authority guarantee from nonvoter