 this commitment object has an increasing reported stored-through index accepted by match. The slot does not independently validate its producer.',{'generation':'commitment object','server':'ServerID','prefix':'matched log index'},'One leader generation and its current voter map',['commitment.matchIndexes'],'Volatile derived support','Fresh leader starts all slots at zero; storage survives separately.',['s-commitment','s-dispatch','s-match-notify','s-snapshot-send'],invalidators=['b-leader-life'],reinterpreters=['b-config'],unknowns=['Backend guarantees and pipeline error handling may affect meaning of producer reports.'])\nfact('f-commit','Majority order statistic of accepted voter match slots passed this generation startIndex and advanced its commit index.',{'generation':'commitment object','prefix':'commitIndex'},'Current voter set at recalculation; startIndex identifies first new-term entry',['commitment.commitIndex','commitCh notification'],'Volatile aggregation; committed history retained through log/snapshot mechanisms.','Re-established using new leader support and propagated commit information.',['s-commitment'],unknowns=['Follower LeaderCommitIndex consumption is an additional authority input, not a locally recomputed quorum.'])\nfact('f-fsm-queued','A committed command/barrier/configuration tuple was sent to the FSM mutation channel, optionally associated with its original future.',{'entry':'log Index and Term','future':'logFuture pointer if local'},'processLogs committed bound and lastApplied traversal',['commitTuple','fsmMutateCh'],'Volatile queue','Snapshot restore and subsequent committed log traversal reconstruct application state.',['s-dispatch'],unknowns=['Queue admission is not completed application.'])\nfact('f-applied','The FSM Apply/ApplyBatch call for a command returned and its associated future response was assigned before successful response notification.',{'entry':'log Index and Term','future':'logFuture'},'runFSM processed command tuple',['