ation and submitted a Boolean leadership notification, without carrying peer suffrage or reply term into vote().',{'worker':'followerReplication','future':'verifyFuture pointer'},'Pending worker notification registration in current leader state',['notify map','verifyFuture.vote(bool)'],'Volatile','Pending futures fail on leader exit; not restored.',['s-replication','s-match-notify','s-heartbeat','s-verify-vote'],invalidators=['b-leader-life'],unknowns=['Registration timing versus already in-flight replies and configuration changes needs focused analysis.'])\nroles=json.load(open('../research.json'))['activity_roles']\nacts=[]\nfor a in roles:\n bs=[b for b in B if b['primary_activity']==a]\n acts.append(dict(class_id=a,applicability='applicable',purpose=roles[a]['relation'],realization_summary='; '.join(b['execution_owner'] for b in bs),entry_points=[b['trigger'] for b in bs],source_ids=sorted(set(s for b in bs for s in b['source_ids'])),unknowns=[]))\ndef path(ex,b,f,s): return dict(explanation=ex,behavior_ids=b,fact_ids=f,source_ids=s)\noverview=dict(status='usable',rationale='Source-grounded navigation of normal formation, election/context change, old-work cleanup and necessary membership/recovery/application support. Usable means sufficient initial mechanism understanding for a local question, not a correctness claim or verified fault coverage.',formation=path('ApplyLog creates a command future and sends applyCh. The leader main loop rejects transfer/removal cases or assigns term/index and stores a batch. Successful local storage and successful per-peer append/snapshot paths report indices into the leader-generation commitment. Only current voter slots count; the majority index must reach the first index of this leader term. The commit notification makes the leader record commitIndex, commit configuration changes and enqueue indexed work to processLogs/runFSM. Replication requests propagate LeaderCommitIndex; followers validate previous entries, reconcile/store 